-General/Five-Shale-Stocks-to-Watch-Before-Third-Quarter-Earnings.html"/><id>urn:nt:3e060d05f40b04</id><updated>2026-10-13T21:00:00+00:00</updated><summary>Permian producers spent much of this year paying buyers to haul away the natural gas that comes up with their oil. Waha Hub spot prices stayed below zero for a record 90 days in a row before turning positive on June 16, Reuters reported, and the hub had averaged minus $2.19 per million British thermal units for the year up to that point. Four of the five companies below still posted record results</summary><author><name>OilPrice.com</name></author><category term="markets"/><category term="markets"/><category term="oil"/></entry><entry><title>8-K - CIRRUS LOGIC, INC. (0000772406) (Filer)</title><link href="https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/772406/000077240626000047/0000772406-26-000047-index.htm"/><id>urn:nt:96ab468356fc1a</id><updated>2026-10-13T20:59:57+00:00</updated><summary>Filed: 2026-10-13 AccNo: 0000772406-26-000047 Size: 140 KB Item 7.01: Regulation FD Disclosure</summary><author><name>SEC EDGAR 8-K</name></author><category term="filings"/><category term="markets"/></entry><entry><title>8-K - MINERALS TECHNOLOGIES INC (0000891014) (Filer)</title><link href="https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/891014/000095015726001098/0000950157-26-001098-index.htm"/><id>urn:nt:8c076c2ccc7fa9</id><updated>2026-10-13T20:58:36+00:00</updated><summary>Filed: 2026-10-13 AccNo: 0000950157-26-001098 Size: 2 MB Item 1.01: Entry into a Material Definitive Agreement Item 2.03: Creation of a Direct Financial Obligation or an Obligation under an Off-Balance Sheet Arrangement of a Registrant Item 9.01: Financial Statements and Exhibits</summary><author><name>SEC EDGAR 8-K</name></author><category term="filings"/><category term="markets"/></entry><entry><title>D - Poppins Inc (0002160086) (Filer)</title><link href="https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2160086/000216008626000001/0002160086-26-000001-index.htm"/><id>urn:nt: